WEBVTT

00:00:02.156 --> 00:00:03.564
This is the payments portal for the

00:00:03.607 --> 00:00:05.996
orchestrator, Unicity's in-house payment service.

00:00:06.721 --> 00:00:07.873
The Payments team runs it here,

00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:08.915
without a developer.

00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:11.287
Nine pages, and three jobs:

00:00:11.713 --> 00:00:13.420
connect, route, and see.

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:16.007
Job one:

00:00:16.246 --> 00:00:16.946
connect.

00:00:17.056 --> 00:00:19.019
Processors is where Payments connects our

00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:19.762
merchant accounts.

00:00:20.043 --> 00:00:21.067
Six are connected today,

00:00:21.579 --> 00:00:24.438
across Worldpay, Nuvei, Braintree for

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.144
PayPal, and Network Merchants,

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.363
each one tested and switched on here.

00:00:29.653 --> 00:00:31.786
Checkout previews the payment form exactly

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.896
as a shopper sees it:

00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:34.474
that market's ways to pay,

00:00:34.858 --> 00:00:36.181
and its own address layout,

00:00:36.352 --> 00:00:37.845
at desktop or mobile size.

00:00:39.355 --> 00:00:41.360
Settings holds the keys our servers use.

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:44.261
Rotate one, and the old key keeps working

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.651
for twenty-four hours, so checkout never breaks.

00:00:48.217 --> 00:00:50.179
And Team shows everyone who can sign in.

00:00:50.478 --> 00:00:52.611
An admin invites a teammate by link,

00:00:52.953 --> 00:00:54.361
and everyone has their own login,

00:00:54.659 --> 00:00:56.025
so every change carries a name.

00:00:57.958 --> 00:00:58.658
Job two:

00:00:58.897 --> 00:00:59.517
route.

00:00:59.537 --> 00:01:01.841
Routing decides which processor account

00:01:01.926 --> 00:01:02.950
charges each payment.

00:01:04.079 --> 00:01:05.401
Here is rule one for Canada:

00:01:05.828 --> 00:01:07.577
paid by card, in Canadian dollars.

00:01:08.887 --> 00:01:11.234
It sends eighty of every hundred payments

00:01:11.362 --> 00:01:14.007
to the Nuvei account, and twenty to Worldpay.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.636
If the first account cannot take a

00:01:16.679 --> 00:01:17.916
payment, the next one tries.

00:01:18.641 --> 00:01:20.519
Anything no rule matches goes to the

00:01:20.561 --> 00:01:21.261
fallback account.

00:01:22.366 --> 00:01:23.646
And before a rule is published,

00:01:23.988 --> 00:01:26.036
a dry run shows where a payment would land.

00:01:26.761 --> 00:01:27.998
Forty-three tried so far,

00:01:28.425 --> 00:01:30.430
and all forty-three went where the rules said.

00:01:32.321 --> 00:01:33.021
Job three:

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:34.002
see.

00:01:34.284 --> 00:01:35.905
Payments shows every payment.

00:01:36.246 --> 00:01:38.294
Open one, and every attempt is there:

00:01:38.678 --> 00:01:39.788
the processor that took it,

00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:40.658
and how it ended.

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.860
This one was paid on its third attempt.

00:01:44.376 --> 00:01:46.722
Orders shows that same payment under our

00:01:46.765 --> 00:01:47.746
own order reference.

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:51.365
Webhooks are the signed messages that tell

00:01:51.408 --> 00:01:52.262
our systems what happened.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.182
Here is the one for that payment:

00:01:54.608 --> 00:01:56.784
delivered, with the reply exactly as

00:01:56.827 --> 00:01:58.448
received, and it can be sent again.

00:01:59.832 --> 00:02:01.325
And the Dashboard adds it all up:

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:03.672
eleven figures, each compared with the

00:02:03.714 --> 00:02:04.414
period before.

00:02:04.909 --> 00:02:06.872
One of them counts payments that succeeded

00:02:06.957 --> 00:02:08.877
after a decline, like the one we just followed.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.090
That is the payments portal for the

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:12.833
orchestrator today.

00:02:13.541 --> 00:02:14.864
Payments connects the accounts,

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.741
sets and tests the routing,

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.658
and sees every payment, in one place.

